{
  "label": "saradate10",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label saradate10:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I tap on Sara’s name in my phone and wait for her to answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s relatively windy out today, but that doesn’t stop me from wanting to wander around outside for a bit.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And if there is anyone I know who likes wandering around the city with me (And routinely stopping to buy candy because she is a child trapped in a woman’s body), it’s Sara.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But hey, if a few stops at convenience stores are all it takes to be seen in public with an attractive woman that’s actually close to my age...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I guess that’s a price I’m willing to pay.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mmn...hello?...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey. You’re not just waking up now, are you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What time is it?...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s a little past noon.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ngh...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I drank too much last night...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, that sounds on-brand.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Want to subject yourself to sensory overload and go walk around the urban district for a little while?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mnh...when?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like, now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guh...okaaaaay.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll start getting ready...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sara hangs up and I begin to make my way to the same huge office building we normally meet at when we decide to visit that part of town.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Knowing that it will likely be a while until she gets there, I stop for coffee at a nearby cafe (One without any [[confirmed] manga club members working) and pick something up for Sara as well.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard1.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Unfortunately, she is one of those cowards who is incapable of drinking black coffee, so I wind up consuming two drinks instead of one.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That’s fine, though.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Caffeine is one of those drugs that you can’t overdose on.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Probably.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And, even in the event that I somehow did, she’ll be here to call an ambulance.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m sure today will proceed just fine with all of that in mind.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You look really good for someone battling a hangover right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks~",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The trick is to just drink more as soon as you wake up so your brain can go back to feeling good.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s not a trick, that’s alcoholism.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just call it having a good time.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That is also alcoholism.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have a problem.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard2.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I do not! It’s not like I do this every morning, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just got a call from Haru-chan really late last night because she was feeling all lonely again.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So the two of us did what any good friends would do and got drunk on the phone and cried to each other about all kinds of stuff.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m kind of glad I don’t have any friends as close as that. That sounds horrible.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if sarasex == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard3.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s not true. I’m your friend, Sensei~",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I think we’re plenty close.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So close that you get to stick it in me while my daughter is downstairs. Isn’t that great?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For us? Yes. For your daughter? No.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well I think it’s great.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don't you think it’s like...about time we told her, though?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least that way, we probably wouldn’t have to worry about her walking in on us.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I prefer to keep my relationships secret, if you don’t mind.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Especially from people as pure as Sana.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard4.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, please. She’s a growing girl. I’m sure she gets up to all sorts of stuff while she’s alone.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Take that back. I will not allow you to tarnish that girl’s image.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m just saying, I know I did when I was her age.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I was also having sex with my teacher when I was her age, soooo...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe I just have a thing for teachers?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard5.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s not true, Sensei. I think we’re plenty close.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even if you won’t accept my love.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve accepted it. I just can’t return it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, that.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But if you ever feel like calling me in the middle of the night to get drunk and cry, I’ll always be there. Kay?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is not a thing I will ever want. But thanks, Sara.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course~",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard6.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Though, I suppose at this point you’d rather just call my daughter and talk to her instead, wouldn’t you?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not quite sure what you’re insinuating with that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just that she’s getting awfully warmed up to you out of nowhere.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe on account of you visiting her dorm room at night?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard7.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe if I was still her size...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, anyway, why don’t we talk about something else?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Embrace my youthful jealousy, Sensei...Embrace it~",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s less of a youth thing and more of an...innocence thing.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And even then, nothing like that is even close to happening between Sana and me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But...if the opportunity arose...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come on. If there’s anyone who knows what teachers like you think about in their spare time, it’s me.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was barely a freshman when I started sleeping with mine.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s crazy right now to think of Sana doing anything remotely close to what Sara was doing back then.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Will that stop me from thinking about it? Of course not.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "My mind lands on that almost every time I walk into her room.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But it’s just so far out of reach at this point that I don’t even bother addressing it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sara, though-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Those experiences went on to shape the rest of her life.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A lot of people say that the first few years of a child’s life are what go on to sculpt them as a person.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t think I agree with that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I think that people tend to find themselves in their[teen]years- particularly their years in [high_school].",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Which is why I’m so worried about how everyone I know will eventually break down and die.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And how I, too, will become the man who abandoned Sara and her family.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you regret it at all?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard8.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Sleeping with my teacher?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hmm...I guess I do sometimes.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I definitely loved him.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But now I have an adorable little girl who’s going to wind up becoming a better version of me when she's older. And that’s fine.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, even if he wound up being unfaithful, I needed someone like that back then.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Have you always been this-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Needy?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard9.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Probably.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I’d say so.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was kind of like an...anti-Sana when I was in [high_school].",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Instead of closing myself off from everyone, I chose to stay wide open instead.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I would have let anyone in regardless of who they were or what they wanted from me.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I wound up falling for the first person to ever look at me as a girl.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, the first older person at least.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard10.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There were plenty of boys who liked me back then, but I never really had any interest in them since they were all just kids.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like, what could they do for me that I couldn’t do for myself?",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you just wanted to feel loved, right? That’s what you’re making it sound like.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think “protected” is a little closer to what I was looking for.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It would make me happy when I’d get a confession from a boy, but none of them would ever make me feel as safe as someone older with more...power and stuff.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard11.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which is probably one more reason I like you so much.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The only power I have is determining whether a handful of [teenage]girls will make it through their first year of [high_school] or not.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard12.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve got a lot more power than that, Sensei.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have an entire class of girls who look up to you and learn from you.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And with barely any men around, you’re pretty much the only male figure they have in their lives.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Given those kinds of circumstances, I think it’s pretty miraculous you’re as decent as you are.",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/saranikiboard13.webp",
      "alt": "saranikiboard13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If only the same could have been said about Sana’s dad...",
      "spk": "Sara",
      "spkColor": "#66B090",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I take it he was one of those people who abused his position?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene saranikiboard14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
